## Summary
Harden input handling in `hscontrol/templates/register_confirm.go` (flagged by multi_agent_ai).

## Vulnerability
| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| **ID** | V-003 |
| **Severity** | HIGH |
| **Scanner** | multi_agent_ai |
| **Rule** | `V-003` |
| **File** | `hscontrol/templates/register_confirm.go:69` |
| **Assessment** | Defensive hardening |

**Description**: Three web data entry points identified without confirmed input validation. Manual review required to verify validation implementation.

## Threat Model Context

This is a Go service - vulnerabilities in HTTP handlers are remotely exploitable.

## Changes
- `hscontrol/templates/register_confirm.go`

## Behavior Preservation
The change is scoped to 1 file on the vulnerable path; it only tightens handling of untrusted input and leaves valid inputs unaffected.

## Security Invariant
> **Property**: The security boundary is maintained under adversarial input

